    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Come Join the Party!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loud music is blaring from your neighbour's flat. All the while you're dead-tired,  a little introverted and most importantly: not invited. So what are you to do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've finally convinced yourself to stop by, you'll find that partying like a pro is not quite as easy as you would have imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546980/extras/0ab80c1459b62a4acd9554804a01e28a.poster.avif?t=1752576895\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546980/extras/0ab80c1459b62a4acd9554804a01e28a.webm?t=1752576895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546980/extras/0ab80c1459b62a4acd9554804a01e28a.mp4?t=1752576895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Party-Based Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet a bunch of kooky characters:</strong> If you'll manage get a read on them, you might be able to hit it off and become friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles:</strong> More and more of the party will become accessible to you, as you help out some of the partygoers.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan out your actions:</strong> In this turn-based time progression system, deciding when to do what is essential for getting the most out of your night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Increase your Stats:</strong> Some partygoers may require you to refine certain social abilities. Strengthen them, to become a better conversationalist.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect phone numbers:</strong> Befriended characters will want to keep in touch with you. The'll also provide you with helpful tips if you don't know how to proceed.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple playthroughs: </strong>You might be able to gather some hints concerning some of the guests deepest secrets. Being observant is the key to uncovering the games multiple endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546980/extras/06fcb2bef6429d08675e589b60ae5d52.poster.avif?t=1752576895\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546980/extras/06fcb2bef6429d08675e589b60ae5d52.webm?t=1752576895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546980/extras/06fcb2bef6429d08675e589b60ae5d52.mp4?t=1752576895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So get out there and have yourself an unforgettable night!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546980/extras/d451d9de0aa0cae9c066067ec7023488.poster.avif?t=1752576895\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546980/extras/d451d9de0aa0cae9c066067ec7023488.apng?t=1752576895\" class=\"bb_img\" width=96 height=144 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546980/extras/c5ead2628b444a4cbb47ccacaee25f73.poster.avif?t=1752576895\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546980/extras/c5ead2628b444a4cbb47ccacaee25f73.apng?t=1752576895\" class=\"bb_img\" width=96 height=144 /></picture></span>\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546980/extras/e17a8c114b7b2be60182f4c1dca7d742.poster.avif?t=1752576895\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546980/extras/e17a8c114b7b2be60182f4c1dca7d742.apng?t=1752576895\" class=\"bb_img\" width=96 height=144 /></picture></span> \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546980/extras/f36815342440573dc5fefcd2fd9a98a9.poster.avif?t=1752576895\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546980/extras/f36815342440573dc5fefcd2fd9a98a9.apng?t=1752576895\" class=\"bb_img\" width=96 height=144 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546980/extras/2e36a5b33ff6a06fae194b71b0c75720.poster.avif?t=1752576895\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546980/extras/2e36a5b33ff6a06fae194b71b0c75720.gif?t=1752576895\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p>",
